    "updated_at": "2018-03-20T06:52:36Z",
    "body": "One corner case that also needs attention is rendering of `<meter min=0 value=0 max=0>0/0</meter>`. Should `<meter>` support indeterminate similar to `<progress>`? If `min=value=max` (allowed by the spec) the meter could logically be empty, indeterminate and full at the same time.",
